Intentionally tracked, and intentionally the only tracked file in this directory.

pyproject.toml force-includes `web/build` into the wheel
(`[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel.force-include]`), so hatchling fails with
"Forced include not found" if the path is absent. That failure happens while the
project is being installed editable into the pixi environment, which means a
fresh clone cannot create its environment — and so cannot run the very task
(`pixi run build-web`) that would have created this directory.

Committing the empty directory breaks that cycle: `pixi run dev` works
immediately after `git clone`. Everything `npm run build` writes here stays
ignored.
